{
  "author": "Portal Suite",
  "content": "<section style=\"margin:0 0 22px;padding:18px 16px;border-left:5px solid #C9A227;background:#F7F3E8\"><p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#7A5B12;font-size:14px;font-weight:700\">Portal Suite</p><p style=\"margin:0;color:#142033;font-size:21px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.4\">伯恩斯坦：大陆集团业务与季度数据观察</p></section>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">大陆集团<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>财报最值得关注的不是当季表现，而是管理层在交出<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>成绩单之后，选择维持全年指引不变。这份<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>研报的标题已经点明核心矛盾：<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">Q2</span> beat，FY guidance only reiterated not raised。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\"><span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>调整后EBIT为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.7亿</span>欧元，较市场共识高出<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5.7%</span>，轮胎业务利润率达到<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.3%</span>，显著高于市场预期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.6%</span>。但全年轮胎业务指引仍维持在130至145个基点的利润率区间，营收指引132至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">142亿</span>欧元也未作调整。按此推算，下半年轮胎利润率隐含区间为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11.5%</span>至14.0%，同比可能下降最多300个基点。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">市场原本普遍预期公司会借<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>势头上调全年指引，毕竟上半年轮胎利润率已达<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.9%</span>，接近现有指引上限。管理层没有这么做，给出的理由是中东局势推高原材料成本，同时下调了全球轻型车产量和替换胎市场预期。全球轻型车产量预期从此前的-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0%</span>下调至-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3%</span>至-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1%</span>，替换胎市场预期也下调1个百分点，欧洲和北美需求均弱于此前判断。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOVWvlbnwUSvU6HpwGycVcXQjePNeW2ySWD90WwvMzSdudHlibwMibEJ55pQP994GYzXuib3tOR7PNBVlSnjRGevn3ATuo2SayqxnQ/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">价格数据与市场变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">轮胎业务<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>销量同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.3%</span>，好于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期的-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.0%</span>，但弱于米其林集团层面的-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.5%</span>。考虑到大陆集团在欧洲敞口更高，而欧洲乘用车胎市场相对更强，这个销量差距值得留意。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">价格与产品组合贡献为+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">2.6%</span>，表现扎实，但环比<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>的+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">4.0%</span>有所回落。研报指出，利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>主要来自18英寸以上大尺寸轮胎的份额提升、原材料成本下降、汇率同比有利以及关税效应。这些因素叠加，推动轮胎业务利润率从去年同期的<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">12.1%</span>升至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">15.3%</span>。</p>\n<section style=\"margin:18px 0;padding:13px 15px;background:#F1F8F4;border-left:4px solid #2F8F5B;color:#223044;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75\"><strong><span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">编辑评论</span>：</strong> <span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>利润率<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">超预期</span>更多来自成本端和产品结构，而非销量增长。下半年原材料成本不确定性<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700\">回升</span>后，利润率能否维持在这个水平，取决于价格组合的持续性。</section>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOXmjEV791XMficw6y98ibDrUibnXWHSTez3uZEJXQQ0fbicWZiarO6skzlVOvFHxGsdeMTVzeG5DHNFfYPia4KogqPFgCiaictxLssodNU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">2. ContiTech已转入终止经营，<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>利润率略低于共识</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">ContiTech在7月以<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">40亿</span>欧元出售后已转入终止经营，本季度报表中该业务收入为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11亿</span>欧元，同比下滑<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">29.5%</span>，主要受OESL业务影响。有机增速为-<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">3.7%</span>，低于<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700\">Bernstein</span>预期的+<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">0.5%</span>。调整后EBIT利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">6.9%</span>，略低于市场共识的7.0%。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">研报提到，高利润率细分领域的订单要等到下半年交付后才能反映在报表中。<span style=\"color:#2F8F5B;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">这意味着</span>ContiTech当前的调整更多是周期性和交付节奏问题，而非业务本身的结构性变化。出售完成后，大陆集团的报表将聚焦轮胎单一业务，可比性反而更清晰。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOX0p6WKX8fIUwcnqzPCdLFn5Tv925a87q9x8qWS1Tk5nAA8rONeGkhXxEBXFrwuexib2wgfsY8leib1xwUGuKHvIvyEOdtbr2TEU/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"研报原图 3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:22px 0 10px;color:#1f2f46;font-size:18px;line-height:1.4\">研究主题与行业变化观察</h3>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">管理层对持续经营业务的全年指引中，轮胎业务营收132至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">142亿</span>欧元、利润率<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">13.0%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">14.5%</span>，均与<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">一季度</span>持平。调整后自由现金流指引为7至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">11亿</span>欧元，较此前下调<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">1亿</span>欧元，但研报认为这主要反映口径从集团整体转为持续经营业务。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0;line-height:1.78;color:#202631;font-size:16px\">资本开支占营收比重仍预计在<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">7.0%</span>至<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">8.0%</span>区间，尽管<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">二季度</span>实际仅为<span style=\"color:#2457A7;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline\">5%</span>。</p>\n<p style=\"margin:28px 0 0;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #D9DEE7;color:#8A93A3;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6\">For informational purposes only. Portions may be generated, translated, summarized, or edited with AI assistance based on source materials and may contain omissions or errors. Please verify independently. This is not investment, legal, tax, accounting, or other professional advice.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:14px 0;text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/YBsHov7VYOWEJ1kMWYL7ZNZA5HbKMiat56fhM2zWYI423qnicr7zxTN1wS5hqAc35ibF3RsIujpNcy31ialf0aE6dpOM0OkK7ib8QuldKUBREicKs/0?from=appmsg\" alt=\"Portal Suite\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;color:#A3ABB8;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;text-align:left\">Original report: 06-Bernstein-Continental AG-CON.GR-Continental Q2 2026- Q2 beat- FY guidance -only- reiterated not raised-260804</p>\n<p style=\"margin:16px 0 0;padding:14px 16px;background:#EAF2FB;border-left:4px solid #2E6FB7;color:#152033;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;font-weight:600\">更新信息参见portal.example.invalid</p>",
